            <Info type="Revision" date="2023-01-26T03:25:09">New fixture type based on Titan Strobe BLAZE from Showtec</Info>
            <Info type="Revision" date="2023-01-26T02:25:10">v20230126</Info>
            <Info>The Showtec Titan Strobe BLAZE is a perfect enhancement of the traditional Titan Strobe.

The RGB LEDs provide a colorful illumination of the reflector. The pre-programmed color macros are divided into zones, in order to create color flows.

The built-in lightning simulation, linear and random strobe effects, blinder and single flash mode make the new Titan Strobe BLAZE the complete package for all professional lighting operators.</Info>
